---
// Features.astro - Editorial Swiss Architecture: No Cards, No Gray Card Borders, No Border Radius
---

<section id="fitur" class="py-24 md:py-32 bg-white relative border-b border-slate-200">
  <div class="max-w-[1586px] mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-9">
    <!-- Section Header -->
    <div class="max-w-3xl mb-16 md:mb-20" data-aos="fade-up">
      <span class="category">Fitur Utama Sistem</span>
      <h2 class="text-3xl sm:text-4xl lg:text-5xl font-extrabold text-[#0f172a] tracking-tight mb-4">
        Manajemen File Modern Tanpa Batasan Konvensional.
      </h2>
      <p class="text-lg text-[#64748b] leading-relaxed">
        Yonopod memadukan efisiensi biaya Rp 250/GB dengan kapabilitas pengelolaan data yang presisi, dirancang untuk kecepatan dan transparansi total.
      </p>
    </div>

    <!-- 6 Features in Clean Editorial Grid (NO CARDS, NO GRAY CARD BORDERS, NO RADIUS) -->
    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3 gap-8 lg:gap-10">
      
      <!-- Feature 1: Tag & Label -->
      <div class="flex flex-col justify-between interactive-tilt p-6 border border-slate-200/60 bg-slate-50/40 hover:bg-white transition-all group" data-aos="fade-up" data-aos-delay="50">
        <div>
          <div class="text-xs font-mono font-bold text-[#2563eb] mb-2 tracking-widest uppercase">
            01 / PENGORGANISIRAN
          </div>
          <h3 class="text-2xl font-bold text-[#0f172a] mb-3 group-hover:text-[#2563eb] transition-colors">Tag & Label Multi-Dimensi</h3>
          <p class="text-sm text-[#64748b] leading-relaxed mb-6">
            Bebaskan file Anda dari kungkungan folder tunggal. Berikan tag seperti <code>#Pekerjaan</code>, <code>#Skripsi</code>, atau <code>#Invoice</code> agar file mudah ditemukan kembali dalam hitungan detik tanpa perlu menggandakan file fisik.
          </p>
        </div>

        <!-- Flat Technical Strip -->
        <div class="p-3 bg-slate-100 flex flex-wrap gap-2 text-[11px] font-mono">
          <span class="px-2 py-0.5 bg-blue-600 text-white font-semibold">#KULIAH</span>
          <span class="px-2 py-0.5 bg-[#06b6d4] text-[#042f2e] font-semibold">#ARSIP-2026</span>
          <span class="px-2 py-0.5 bg-emerald-600 text-white font-semibold">#INVOICE</span>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Feature 2: Folder Size Analyzer -->
      <div class="flex flex-col justify-between interactive-tilt p-6 border border-slate-200/60 bg-slate-50/40 hover:bg-white transition-all group" data-aos="fade-up" data-aos-delay="100">
        <div>
          <div class="text-xs font-mono font-bold text-[#06b6d4] mb-2 tracking-widest uppercase">
            02 / ANALITIK KUOTA
          </div>
          <h3 class="text-2xl font-bold text-[#0f172a] mb-3 group-hover:text-[#06b6d4] transition-colors">Folder Size Analyzer</h3>
          <p class="text-sm text-[#64748b] leading-relaxed mb-6">
            Ketahui secara akurat folder mana yang paling banyak mengonsumsi ruang penyimpanan. Deteksi penumpukan file duplikat lama dan pangkas inefisiensi ruang hingga <strong>lebih dari 50%</strong> secara instan.
          </p>
        </div>

        <!-- Flat Technical Strip -->
        <div class="p-3 bg-slate-100 font-mono text-xs">
          <div class="flex justify-between mb-1.5 text-[11px] text-slate-800">
            <span>/Assets-Media-Video</span>
            <span class="font-bold text-[#2563eb]">14.2 GB (72%)</span>
          </div>
          <div class="w-full h-1.5 bg-slate-300 overflow-hidden">
            <div class="h-full bg-[#2563eb] w-[72%]"></div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Feature 3: Private Vault (AES-256) -->
      <div class="flex flex-col justify-between interactive-tilt p-6 border border-slate-200/60 bg-slate-50/40 hover:bg-white transition-all group" data-aos="fade-up" data-aos-delay="150">
        <div>
          <div class="text-xs font-mono font-bold text-indigo-600 mb-2 tracking-widest uppercase">
            03 / FILE TRANSFER
          </div>
          <h3 class="text-2xl font-bold text-[#0f172a] mb-3 group-hover:text-indigo-600 transition-colors">Cloudflare R2</h3>
          <p class="text-sm text-[#64748b] leading-relaxed mb-6">
            Jangan khawatir proses upload macet ditengah jalan. Support Multipart upload yang didukung langsung oleh R2 hingga file size <strong>10 GB</strong>.
          </p>
        </div>

        <!-- Flat Technical Strip -->
        <div class="p-3 bg-slate-100 flex items-center justify-between text-xs font-mono">
          <span class="text-slate-700">SIZE: 10 GB</span>
          <span class="px-2 py-0.5 bg-[#0a0e1a] text-[#06b6d4] font-bold text-[10px]">CONTINUE UPLOAD</span>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Feature 4: Audit Log -->
      <div class="flex flex-col justify-between interactive-tilt p-6 border border-slate-200/60 bg-slate-50/40 hover:bg-white transition-all group" data-aos="fade-up" data-aos-delay="200">
        <div>
          <div class="text-xs font-mono font-bold text-emerald-600 mb-2 tracking-widest uppercase">
            04 / TRANSPARANSI
          </div>
          <h3 class="text-2xl font-bold text-[#0f172a] mb-3 group-hover:text-emerald-600 transition-colors">Aktivitas Detail (Audit Log)</h3>
          <p class="text-sm text-[#64748b] leading-relaxed mb-6">
            Rekam jejak komprehensif untuk setiap file: siapa yang mengunggah, mengganti nama, memindahkan, memperbarui isi, atau mengunduh. Tidak ada celah keraguan mengenai integritas dokumen.
          </p>
        </div>

        <!-- Flat Technical Strip -->
        <div class="p-3 bg-slate-100 text-[11px] font-mono text-slate-700 space-y-1">
          <div class="truncate">✓ [08:12] `kontrak.pdf` diunduh</div>
          <div class="truncate text-[#06b6d4] font-bold">✓ [09:45] `schema.sql` diperbarui</div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Feature 5: Real-time Dashboard -->
      <div class="flex flex-col justify-between interactive-tilt p-6 border border-slate-200/60 bg-slate-50/40 hover:bg-white transition-all group" data-aos="fade-up" data-aos-delay="250">
        <div>
          <div class="text-xs font-mono font-bold text-amber-600 mb-2 tracking-widest uppercase">
            05 / PEMANTAUAN
          </div>
          <h3 class="text-2xl font-bold text-[#0f172a] mb-3 group-hover:text-amber-600 transition-colors">Dashboard Monitoring Real-time</h3>
          <p class="text-sm text-[#64748b] leading-relaxed mb-6">
            Pantau sebaran penyimpanan Anda per kategori file (Dokumen, Gambar, Video, Source Code, Arsip). Terima notifikasi sebelum kapasitas mendekati batas atau saldo perlu diisi ulang.
          </p>
        </div>

        <!-- Flat Technical Strip -->
        <div class="p-3 bg-slate-100 flex items-center justify-between text-xs font-mono text-slate-700">
          <span>DOKUMEN: 34%</span>
          <span>MEDIA: 52%</span>
          <span>ARSIP: 14%</span>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Feature 6: Sharing Controls -->
      <div class="flex flex-col justify-between interactive-tilt p-6 border border-slate-200/60 bg-slate-50/40 hover:bg-white transition-all group" data-aos="fade-up" data-aos-delay="300">
        <div>
          <div class="text-xs font-mono font-bold text-purple-600 mb-2 tracking-widest uppercase">
            06 / AKSES & BERBAGI
          </div>
          <h3 class="text-2xl font-bold text-[#0f172a] mb-3 group-hover:text-purple-600 transition-colors">Tautan Berbagi Fleksibel</h3>
          <p class="text-sm text-[#64748b] leading-relaxed mb-6">
            Kendalikan distribusi dokumen dengan presisi. Tambahkan kata sandi pada tautan, tentukan tanggal kedaluwarsa, batasi jumlah unduhan maksimum, atau tetapkan izin hanya-baca (read-only).
          </p>
        </div>

        <!-- Flat Technical Strip -->
        <div class="p-3 bg-slate-100 flex items-center justify-between text-xs font-mono">
          <span class="text-slate-700">PASSWORD: AKTIF</span>
          <span class="text-purple-700 font-bold">LIMIT: -</span>
        </div>
      </div>

    </div>
  </div>
</section>
